---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lang = 'es' as const;
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Mensaje Enviado · Gracias | Guíñez Galaz Abogados"
  description="Hemos recibido tu consulta. Nos pondremos en contacto a la brevedad."
  lang={lang}
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="gracias-section">
    <div class="gracias-card">
      <div class="check-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/>
          <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <p class="label">GUÍÑEZ GALAZ ABOGADOS</p>
      <h1 class="title">¡Mensaje recibido!</h1>
      <p class="body">
        Hemos recibido tu consulta y nos pondremos en contacto contigo dentro de
        <strong>24–48 horas hábiles</strong>. Si necesitas una respuesta urgente, escríbenos por WhatsApp.
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a href="/es" class="btn-primary">Volver al inicio</a>
        <a href="/es/areas-practica" class="btn-outline">Ver áreas de práctica</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .gracias-section {
    min-height: calc(100vh - 80px);
    background: #F5F5F0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .gracias-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #E8E8E0;
    max-width: 560px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 3.5rem 3rem;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(13, 31, 45, 0.06);
  }

  .check-icon {
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    background: rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.25);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;
  }

  .label {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: #C9A84C;
    margin-bottom: 0.875rem;
  }

  .title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.875rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0D1F2D;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1.125rem;
  }

  .body {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.72);
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .body strong { color: #0D1F2D; font-weight: 600; }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #ffffff;
    background: #0D1F2D;
    padding: 0.9375rem 2rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: #C9A84C; color: #0D1F2D; }

  .btn-outline {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #0D1F2D;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid #0D1F2D;
    padding: 0.9375rem 2rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .btn-outline:hover { background: #0D1F2D; color: #ffffff; }
</style>
